    "original": "A well-forged estoc requires length and strength while remaining light enough to be quick and nimble in the hand. This blade is one of the finest examples you have ever laid eyes on.",
    "translation": "对于一把精心锻成的穿甲剑来说，在保证重量够轻操纵灵活的同时，长度和强度缺一不可。面前这把正是你所见过最精良的之一。",
    "stage": 1,
    "context": "this.m.Description = \"A well-forged estoc requires length and strength while remaining light enough to be quick and nimble in the hand. This blade is one of the finest examples you have ever laid eyes on.\""
  }
]
